    25	  middle-slack area-relief high-fanout wide-cut guard. It keeps the same
    26	  tight mapper-depth window, but allows the middle-slack relief only in the
    27	  lower moderate fanout bucket, leaving upper-moderate and highest fanout
    28	  nodes on the stricter stmap8-style arrival-bounded guard.]
